#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Units become confused if:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:7
msgid "Burst through by evaders."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:9
msgid "Driven back by missile fire on any Drive Back roll of a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:11
msgid "Driven back or falling back into impassable terrain on the roll of a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:13
msgid "Driven back or falling back into enemies or combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:15
msgid "Forcing friends to make way on the roll of a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:17
msgid "Driven back/falling back into unyielding friends."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:19
msgid "Making way on the roll of a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Unable to fall back to [.bo5a]#at least# 1cm from enemy [.bo5a]#following# "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:25
msgid "Cannot move in the Command phase by either initiative or orders."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:26
msgid "Suffer a −1 Attacks modifier in combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:27
msgid "Cannot support in combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:28
msgid "Cease to be confused at the end of their Command phase."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:33
msgid "Units can make way for friends that are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:34
msgid "Driven back by shooting"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:35
msgid "Retreating from combat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:36
msgid "Making way for another unit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Units engaged in combat, constricted by terrain, or otherwise unable to move "
"cannot make way."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:39
msgid "Units can make way by moving aside or moving back."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:43
msgid ""
"All stands in the path of the friend are moved – all other stands remain in "
"place. Stands are rearranged around those that remain in place."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:45
msgid ""
"If all stands are in the path of the friend, move [.edit]#whichever# stand "
"needs to move the shortest distance to get out of the path.  Rearrange the "
"other stands around this stand."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:49
msgid "The entire unit moves back in the same direction as the friend."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/confusion-at-a-glance.adoc:50
msgid ""
"If infantry move back for other infantry, they can be arranged into support."
msgstr ""
